{"page":186,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.2 • 다중화와 역다중화","words":[{"text":"3.2","x":1119,"y":150,"width":41,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":1194,"y":155,"width":11,"height":14},{"text":"다중화와","x":1240,"y":150,"width":104,"height":31},{"text":"역다중화","x":1354,"y":149,"width":107,"height":30}]},{"text":"서 사용되도록 예약되어 있다. 잘 알리진 포트 번호 목록은 RFC 1700에 명시되이 있","words":[{"text":"서","x":178,"y":279,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"사용되도록","x":224,"y":277,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"예약되어","x":415,"y":278,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":567,"y":277,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"잘","x":656,"y":277,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"알리진","x":702,"y":277,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"포트","x":814,"y":282,"width":62,"height":28},{"text":"번호","x":894,"y":279,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"목록은","x":973,"y":278,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"RFC","x":1089,"y":282,"width":70,"height":29},{"text":"1700에","x":1181,"y":278,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"명시되이","x":1302,"y":277,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"있","x":1451,"y":277,"width":31,"height":37}]},{"text":"고, 이는 http://www.ianaorg에시 갱신된다[RFC 32.3기. 새 에플리게이션을 기|발할","words":[{"text":"고,","x":177,"y":344,"width":41,"height":32},{"text":"이는","x":239,"y":338,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"http://www.ianaorg에시","x":325,"y":336,"width":378,"height":44},{"text":"갱신된다[RFC","x":726,"y":337,"width":212,"height":39},{"text":"32.3기.","x":957,"y":341,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"새","x":1076,"y":337,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"에플리게이션을","x":1128,"y":337,"width":236,"height":38},{"text":"기|발할","x":1383,"y":337,"width":101,"height":37}]},{"text":"때(2.7절의 애플리케이션처럼), 에플리게이신에 포트 번호를 반드시 할당해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"때(2.7절의","x":178,"y":399,"width":162,"height":39},{"text":"애플리케이션처럼),","x":358,"y":397,"width":291,"height":41},{"text":"에플리게이신에","x":664,"y":396,"width":226,"height":38},{"text":"포트","x":905,"y":400,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"번호를","x":988,"y":398,"width":98,"height":36},{